Z||000030||fieroshop||04-24-2001||01:35 AM||||I would like to add one last item. <BR>There are times that I have a car in my shop and I need a part. I have to call a wrecking yard and I am charged 50% of original new part. I do the same. My parts are at 50% of new for the reason that I have a very high overhead as do most shops.<BR>1: Electricity<BR>2: Insurance<BR>3: People that work here and get paid.<BR>4: Telephone and now with a toll free number even more, this number is to help you guys and also I get a lot of calls for technical advice and I do not charge for this.<BR>5: There is also a matter of licenses that I have to pay for each year.<BR>6: Lease on the building<BR>7: There are also a lot of other bills to pay in order for me to stay in business.<BR>Some of you are young and do not know the difference in cost of doing business.<BR>I cannot and will not sell items I make or sell at my cost. I would not be around for very long. (now would I)<BR>It is nice that some of you have bought or received as a gift a parts car. Your livelihood does not depend on making a profit in order to survive. Well our livelihood does and so we might be more expensive then your friend down the street, but we are here to stay and help where we can. If the price is too high for your pocket book, then nothing says that you have to buy from us. <BR>So why  don't we all just go about our business and try to have some fun without having to put somebody down, who is doing what to whom and where is nobodies business except those two people involved,putting a person down shows inmaturity and should not be allowed to be posteds on this forum. Some of you are saying things that you know nothing about and all you can do is talk about people in a derogatory way. (WHY) I am doing what I can to help out where I can. A lot of you have spoken to me on the phone and have asked for advice. You have received this advice for free and I have not asked you to buy from me. That is part of the cost of doing business. After all my time is worth something and I have not and will nocharge for people asking advice, I hope that I can continue to help you out where I can.<BR>One final item and this is for Bill Cady. He is not man enough to say anything to me face to face but hides behind the forum and start problems and then cannot back them up. This is hypocritical in nature and should not be on a forum such as this one.<BR>I personally feel that if somebody has something to say about me or to me, they should be able to and be man enough to come here and say it to my face and not launder his wash in public.<BR>I feel that this has gone far enough and this thread should be closed and not be brought up anymore. I for one am sick and tired of this BS.<BR>This is also one reason I do not post too many items.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif">    <P><p>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||1
